{{Passive skill box|Dance with Death}}
'''Dance with Death''' is a [[keystone passive skill]] which makes both [[Critical strike]] chance and damage with [[Critical strike]]s [[Luck]]y, at the cost of disallowing the use of [[Helmets]] and causing enemies' critical strike damage to be [[Luck]]y against you. Luck only applies to [[hit]] damage, not [[ailment]] DPS.<ref>Confirmed through direct testing by [[Prohibited Library (community)]]. https://discord.com/channels/991073626721763429/991092346651287623/1165229624595316807</ref>

==Location==
This keystone will conquer any keystones within the radius of a {{il|Brutal Restraint}} jewel with modifier {{c|mod|Denoted service of (500–8000) dekhara in the akhara of '''Asenath'''}}.


